PDF: line, polygon, polyline and redaction annotations made and drawn.

zebkit's PDF API makes every kind of annotation a reader adds
(<zebkit/pdf.h>). PDFium makes only some, and generates appearances only for
those: this lets FPDFPage_CreateAnnot() make lines, polygons, polylines and
redaction marks, adds FPDFAnnot_SetVertices() and FPDFAnnot_SetLine() beside
their getters, and generates the appearance of lines, polygons and
polylines from their points, colours and border, as PDFium does for ink.

